

                   ADVENTURER-KINGS:  GAME 3, TURN 8

                                  FOR

                   SHAMAN UGA-BUGA MAKUMBU





                              




  Quote of the Week:

  "It is a political error to practice deceit, if deceit is carried too 
far."
  -Frederick II, King of Prussia, 1740.


ACTION REPORT    

Here's what happened to Your Majesty this turn:


  With the coming of the spring season Uga-Buga Makumb set out to quench his 
thirst for adventure.  Sherwood was magically blessed and prospered.  The 
skeletal remains of the 142nd Legion were Blessed and permanently destroyed. 
The skeletal remains of the 221st Light Cavalry were Blessed and permanently 
destroyed.  Uga-Buga Makumb tried to practice his Necromancy, but the task 
seemed beyond his aptitude.

  Cosmic Herderer Mugai (#3) sent an invasion force into the adjacent Forest 
province of the Buccaneer Sea, owned by Shaman Uga-Buga Makumb Stuffy doll.  
Samantha (#95) commanded the attacking armies.  The defending forces were 
led by the provincial garrison commander.  The armies were drawn up into 
lines of battle as shown here:

  ATTACKING ARMY, Battle of the Buccaneer Sea (0806):

