From: Gunga Din, Squire to Tao-Li
To: Uga-Buga Makumb

  Honored Sovereign, 

  With the advent of the spring season, Tao-Li prepared to quench his thirst 
for adventure.  He roamed around in the Plesiosaurus Sea, exploring the 
terrain there, and now 23% of it has been explored.

  In the Plesiosaurus Sea, Shaman Uga-Buga Makumb Stuffy doll brought to bay 
Kurtinaitis (#62).  Tao-Li commanded the invading armies.  The defenders 
were led by Kurtinaitis.  The armies were drawn up into lines of battle as 
shown here:

