From: Odysseus
To: Uga-Buga Makumb

  Honored Sovereign, 

  With the advent of the spring season, I prepared to quench my thirst for 
glory.  I rode my flying armies over to Mare Ionium.
  The wet spring blossomed into early summer.  I flew into Bir Nzaran.
  I heard tell of an interesting feature in Hollabrand (#1206): a Catacombs 
occupied by the Banshee, who holds the Manual of Spying.
  In late summer, I flew over to Ravenwood.  West of here lies the province 
of the Giant Turtle Sea (#1002), ruled by no one.  It is known to be a Sea 
province inhabited by no races.  Viewing the northwestern horizon, one can 
see a prosperous Sea province called the Cannibal Sea (#1101).  It is said 
that no one is the ruler there.  It is known to be populated by Mermen.  
They can call on an army of Mermen to defend their territory.

  Shaman Uga-Buga Makumb Stuffy doll ordered an invasion force into the 
adjacent Forest province of Ravenwood, owned by York (#67).  I commanded the 
invading armies.  The defending forces were led by York.  The armies were 
drawn up into lines of battle as shown here:

  ATTACKING ARMY, Battle of Ravenwood (1102):

