In my travels, I encountered no monsters.
  In early summer, I explored Falkenheim well and now 87% of it has been 
explored.  During my travels this season, I was ambushed, pinned down and 
severely beaten by wild-eyed soldiers.  I escaped.  A King's Marshal tracked 
me down.  But he was easily dazzled by my tales of my adventures.  He 
saluted me and departed.

  With the coming of the late summer season I travelled to Kumasi.  In my 
travels, I saw no wandering monster.
  The hot days of summer surrendered to the fall.  I travelled throughout 
