explored to date.  I found a feature in Kumasi: a Lost City (#30) inhabited 
by the Renegade Swordsman.  What treasure may lie there is unknown.  
Mercenaries describe the Renegade Swordsman as a famous swordsman who has 
chosen to distance himself from his fellow man and build his power on the 
strength of his swordsmanship.  I encountered no wandering monster.
  In early winter, I roamed around in Kumasi, exploring the terrain there, 
and now 31% of it has been explored.  I encountered no monster.

  Thy humble servant,   Presto


