fields: the 96th Bowmen (Average Elves), the 264th Light Cavalry (Average 
Humans), the 269th Bowmen (Veteran Elves) and the 292nd Fleet (Average Orcs).
During his travels this season, he was crossing an open field when a 
Giant Wasp spotted Marlboro from a distance.  He ran furiously and fled from 
the combat.

  With the advent of the late summer season, Marlboro travelled to Gafsa.  
During his travels this season, he was spotted by a patrol.  Their 
commanding captain suspiciously challenged Marlboro.  But he wasn't listed 
as a renegade outlaw, and that got Marlboro off the hook.

  During fall, Marlboro wandered freely in Gafsa, exploring its secrets, and 
