monster.
  The fall season darkened into early winter.  Marlboro explored Gafsa 
carefully, leaving no stone unturned, and our exploration level there has 
risen to 75%.  Marlboro encountered no monster.

  Thy humble servant,   Mortimer, Squire to Marlboro


